// A prefab: a piece of a place, drawn as rows of glyphs, and what each glyph
// stands for; see `treasure_room.ron` for the full field list.
//
// Lift the prize and water pours in through grates, rising to deep:
// 'P' is a `Mark`, read by `src/vaults.rs`'s own `spawn_flood_trigger`,
// which spawns the prize there and starts the flood on its taking; the
// grates themselves are the decorative "iron grate" either side of it.
(
    name: "The Flooding Vault",
    ground: "hall floor",
    rows: [
        "#######",
        "#g...g#",
        "#.....#",
        "#..P..#",
        "###E###",
    ],
    legend: {
        '#': Tile("hall wall"),
        '.': Tile("hall floor"),
        'g': Prop("iron grate"),
        'P': Mark,
        'E': Entry,
    },
)
